          "content": "**Figure it Out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.511,
            0.883,
            0.565
          ],
          "content": "**Q1. Suppose you start with 0 rupees in your bank account, and then you have credits of** ₹**30,** ₹**40, and** ₹**50, and debits of** ₹**40,** ₹**50, and** ₹**60. What is your bank account balance now?]**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.575,
            0.506,
            0.592
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** (+30) + (+40) + (+50) – (40) – (50) – (60)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.602,
            0.473,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": "Balance amount in Bank Account = ₹ (-30)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.656,
            0.883,
            0.709
          ],
          "content": "**Q2. Suppose you start with 0 rupees in your bank account, and then you have debits of** ₹**1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, and 128, and then a single credit of** ₹**256. What is your bank account balance now?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
